Package: gtkhash
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: GTK utility for computing message digests or checksums
 GtkHash is a desktop utility for computing message digests or checksums
 using the MD5, SHA1, SHA2, SHA3, BLAKE2, GOST, RIPEMD, WHIRLPOOL and many
 other algorithms.
 .
 It features an easy-to-use GUI interface and can be integrated into file
 managers via its context-menu extensions.
